---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — TAROS"
  description="Contact TAROS — Start the conversation about runtime monitoring and oversight for autonomous systems and AI/SI."
  current="contact"
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Contact</h1>
      <p class="lead">Start the conversation.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p>Whether you are evaluating runtime monitoring and oversight for autonomous systems or building a roadmap for responsible AI/SI adoption, we’d like to hear from you.</p>
      <p>Reach out to explore TAROS, discuss your needs, or follow our journey. We’ll respond as soon as we can.</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@gotaros.com">contact@gotaros.com</a></p>
      <p class="section__intro" style="margin-top: 2rem;">If you prefer a different channel, say so in your message and we’ll accommodate.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
